  <div class='flex flex-col items-start gap-2 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 pt-6 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between md:gap-10 dark:border-stone-700'>
    <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty md:max-w-2xl dark:text-stone-400'>Designers and developers at these companies work on the same Starquix project, one per site.</p>
    <a href='#' class='inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center font-sans text-base font-medium text-stone-900 no-underline underline-offset-4 hover:underline focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50 dark:focus-visible:outline-stone-50'>Read customer stories</a>
